{
    "title": "Face Shape & Color Analysis",
    "description": "\"FaceScore\" is an application that scores your facial beauty!\r\nIt analyzes different features of your face and diagnoses how close you are to the golden ratio by giving you a score.\r\nIt also diagnoses your personal color based on the color of your skin, hair and eyes.\r\n\r\nYou can also diagnose your face type and find out celebrities and entertainers whose look like you.\r\nLet's see how perfect you are!\r\n\r\nThe diagnosis results will vary depending on the facial expression and makeup used while the photo was taken.\r\nTry with smiling face, serious face or different makeup styles!\r\nYou will know which color suits you best.\r\n\r\nTry on this application with your family, friends and loved ones!\r\nIt will definitly be a hit at school, at work or at a drinking party!\r\nYou can also share the results with your friends through social media like LINE, Facebook and Twitter.\r\n\r\n\u3010It is easy to use!\u3011\r\n1. Take a picture of your face.\r\n\r\n2. Follow the instructions and set the lines shown on the screen in the appropriate position.\r\n\r\n3. When the analysis is complete, the diagnosis result will be displayed.\r\n\r\n4. You can share the results with your friends.\r\n\r\n\u3010Various results can be found!\u3011\r\nThe score is based on the proportions of each facial features, such as facial contours, eyes, nose, and mouth.\r\nFrom the score, you can know how good is your size, distortion, shape, balance, age, etc.\r\n\r\nThe personal color diagnosis also reveals the colors that suit you.\r\nThe color of your face is determined by your personal color analysis, and you can use your personal color as a reference in doing make-up and dressing on.\r\n\r\n\u3010Makeup advice for you!\u3011\r\nAI will give you advice on how to acheive the golden ratio based on your diagnosis.\r\nYou can find out the hairstyle and makeup that suits you best.\r\n\r\n\u3010AI Chat\uff01\u3011\r\nYou can consult with AI about your beauty and fashion problems and questions.\r\nWe answer questions about skin problems, makeup, diet, plastic surgery, coordination, hairstyles, and much more.\r\n\r\n\u3010Celebrity Diagnosis!\u3011\r\nDiagnose celebrities and entertainers whose facial proportions are similar to yours.\r\nYou will be the next superstar!\r\n\r\n\u3010Styling that suits you!\u3011\r\nWe propose styling for you based on the latest diagnosis results.\r\nYou can see the coordination, makeup, hair style, hair color, etc.\r\nLemon, purple, blue, red, and many other colors are available.\r\n\r\n\u3010What is the golden ratio?\u3011\r\nThe golden ratio of the face is the ratio of the face that is considered beautiful among most of the people.\r\nThe closer to the golden ratio, the more beautiful and attractive the face is.\r\nThere are three elements in the facial proportions that determine how beautiful the face is.\r\n\r\n(1) Overall facial balance (Length, width, length/width ratio, etc.)\r\n(2) Position of each facial features (Position of eyes, nose, mouth, eyebrows, etc.)\r\n(3) Size of each features (Size of the eyes, nose, mouth, etc.)\r\n\r\n\u3010What is personal color?\u3011\r\nPersonal color is the color that best suits a person based on a diagnosis on the color of their skin, hair, eyes, etc.\r\nThere are two main types of hues: yellow-based and blue-based.\r\n\r\nIn addition, there are four types of hues, which are analogous to the four seasons: spring, summer, fall, and winter.\r\nBy incorporating personal color into your makeup, clothing and other aspects of your life, you can make yourself look even more attractive.\r\n\r\nThere are 8 patterns of gender x classification x spring, summer, fall, and winter!\r\n\r\n\u3010Data protection\u3011\r\nDiagnosis results may vary depending on the angle of the face photo taken.\r\nThe photo taken with the application will not be saved.\r\nThe photo taken with the application will not be used for any purpose other than diagnosis.\r\n\r\n\u3010In-app purchase\u3011\r\n- There is a VIP plan that hides advertisements and give further advice on techniques in approaching the golden ratio.\r\n- The subscription period is automatically renewed every month starting from the first date of enrollment.\r\n- You can unsubscribe the plan at least 24 hours before the day of the auto renewal.",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;FaceScore&quot; is an application that scores your facial beauty!<br>It analyzes different features of your face and diagnoses how close you are to the golden ratio by giving you a score.<br>It also diagnoses your personal color based on the color of your skin, hair and eyes.<br><br>You can also diagnose your face type and find out celebrities and entertainers whose look like you.<br>Let&#39;s see how perfect you are!<br><br>The diagnosis results will vary depending on the facial expression and makeup used while the photo was taken.<br>Try with smiling face, serious face or different makeup styles!<br>You will know which color suits you best.<br><br>Try on this application with your family, friends and loved ones!<br>It will definitly be a hit at school, at work or at a drinking party!<br>You can also share the results with your friends through social media like LINE, Facebook and Twitter.<br><br>\u3010It is easy to use!\u3011<br>1. Take a picture of your face.<br><br>2. Follow the instructions and set the lines shown on the screen in the appropriate position.<br><br>3. When the analysis is complete, the diagnosis result will be displayed.<br><br>4. You can share the results with your friends.<br><br>\u3010Various results can be found!\u3011<br>The score is based on the proportions of each facial features, such as facial contours, eyes, nose, and mouth.<br>From the score, you can know how good is your size, distortion, shape, balance, age, etc.<br><br>The personal color diagnosis also reveals the colors that suit you.<br>The color of your face is determined by your personal color analysis, and you can use your personal color as a reference in doing make-up and dressing on.<br><br>\u3010Makeup advice for you!\u3011<br>AI will give you advice on how to acheive the golden ratio based on your diagnosis.<br>You can find out the hairstyle and makeup that suits you best.<br><br>\u3010AI Chat\uff01\u3011<br>You can consult with AI about your beauty and fashion problems and questions.<br>We answer questions about skin problems, makeup, diet, plastic surgery, coordination, hairstyles, and much more.<br><br>\u3010Celebrity Diagnosis!\u3011<br>Diagnose celebrities and entertainers whose facial proportions are similar to yours.<br>You will be the next superstar!<br><br>\u3010Styling that suits you!\u3011<br>We propose styling for you based on the latest diagnosis results.<br>You can see the coordination, makeup, hair style, hair color, etc.<br>Lemon, purple, blue, red, and many other colors are available.<br><br>\u3010What is the golden ratio?\u3011<br>The golden ratio of the face is the ratio of the face that is considered beautiful among most of the people.<br>The closer to the golden ratio, the more beautiful and attractive the face is.<br>There are three elements in the facial proportions that determine how beautiful the face is.<br><br>(1) Overall facial balance (Length, width, length/width ratio, etc.)<br>(2) Position of each facial features (Position of eyes, nose, mouth, eyebrows, etc.)<br>(3) Size of each features (Size of the eyes, nose, mouth, etc.)<br><br>\u3010What is personal color?\u3011<br>Personal color is the color that best suits a person based on a diagnosis on the color of their skin, hair, eyes, etc.<br>There are two main types of hues: yellow-based and blue-based.<br><br>In addition, there are four types of hues, which are analogous to the four seasons: spring, summer, fall, and winter.<br>By incorporating personal color into your makeup, clothing and other aspects of your life, you can make yourself look even more attractive.<br><br>There are 8 patterns of gender x classification x spring, summer, fall, and winter!<br><br>\u3010Data protection\u3011<br>Diagnosis results may vary depending on the angle of the face photo taken.<br>The photo taken with the application will not be saved.<br>The photo taken with the application will not be used for any purpose other than diagnosis.<br><br>\u3010In-app purchase\u3011<br>- There is a VIP plan that hides advertisements and give further advice on techniques in approaching the golden ratio.<br>- The subscription period is automatically renewed every month starting from the first date of enrollment.<br>- You can unsubscribe the plan at least 24 hours before the day of the auto renewal.",
